## ⚛️ React Native Best Practices

### Styles
```typescript
// ✅ Always use StyleSheet.create
const styles = StyleSheet.create({
  container: {
    flex: 1,
    backgroundColor: '#fff',
  },
});

// ❌ Avoid inline styles (performance impact)
<View style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#fff' }} />
```

### Animations
```typescript
// ✅ ALWAYS use useNativeDriver when possible
Animated.timing(animatedValue, {
  toValue: 1,
  duration: 300,
  useNativeDriver: true, // ✅ Critical for performance
}).start();

// ✅ Use Reanimated for complex animations
import { useSharedValue, withSpring } from 'react-native-reanimated';

const offset = useSharedValue(0);
offset.value = withSpring(100);
```

### Lists
```typescript
// ✅ Use FlatList for large lists
<FlatList
  data={players}
  renderItem={({ item }) => <PlayerCard player={item} />}
  keyExtractor={item => item.id}
  getItemLayout={(data, index) => ({
    length: ITEM_HEIGHT,
    offset: ITEM_HEIGHT * index,
    index,
  })}
/>

// ❌ Avoid .map() for large lists (performance)
{players.map(player => <PlayerCard key={player.id} player={player} />)}
```

### Platform-Specific Code
```typescript
import { Platform, StyleSheet } from 'react-native';

const styles = StyleSheet.create({
  container: {
    ...Platform.select({
      ios: { paddingTop: 20 },
      android: { paddingTop: 0 },
    }),
  },
});
```

### Haptic Feedback
```typescript
import ReactNativeHapticFeedback from 'react-native-haptic-feedback';

// User actions
ReactNativeHapticFeedback.trigger('impactLight');   // Light tap
ReactNativeHapticFeedback.trigger('impactMedium');  // Medium action
ReactNativeHapticFeedback.trigger('impactHeavy');   // Heavy action

// Notifications
ReactNativeHapticFeedback.trigger('notificationSuccess');
ReactNativeHapticFeedback.trigger('notificationWarning');
ReactNativeHapticFeedback.trigger('notificationError');
```

