## ✅ Pre-Commit Checklist

### Code Quality
- [ ] No TypeScript `any` types used
- [ ] All functions have proper types/interfaces
- [ ] JSDoc comments added for complex functions
- [ ] No unused variables or imports
- [ ] No console.log in production code

### Performance
